      "paperId": "aedff7a6cb06743a7714207fa3fb5bc1e1602c26",
      "title": "THE INTELLECTUAL LEGACY OF CRITICAL THEORY: ORIGINS, TRANSFORMATIONS, AND INTERGENERATIONAL DIALOGUES",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "M. H. Ar\u0131t\u00fcrk",
